0.4666},{"ratio":0.9,"watchRatio":0.4647},{"ratio":0.91,"watchRatio":0.45840000000000003},{"ratio":0.92,"watchRatio":0.45255},{"ratio":0.93,"watchRatio":0.4476},{"ratio":0.94,"watchRatio":0.44489999999999996},{"ratio":0.95,"watchRatio":0.43879999999999997},{"ratio":0.96,"watchRatio":0.4322},{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.4226},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.40835},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.39625},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.3913}],"script":{"source_path":"w2QxVxOlicg.en-orig.vtt","words":158,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"Remember this scene of Amitabh Bachchan"},{"sec":1.8,"text":"burning his shikha, but under"},{"sec":3.2,"text":"Portuguese, Hindus in Goa had to pay a"},{"sec":5.4,"text":"Catholic jizya to keep this. The"},{"sec":7.3,"text":"Portuguese were inspired by Aurangzeb"},{"sec":9.4,"text":"and they imposed this discriminatory tax"},{"sec":11.8,"text":"on non-Christians of their dominions."},{"sec":13.6,"text":"But why? Well, they had a problem and"},{"sec":15.8,"text":"they created it themselves. Their own"},{"sec":17.8,"text":"laws against non-Catholics had pushed"},{"sec":19.7,"text":"Goa's Hindu merchants out with their"},{"sec":21.6,"text":"families and their money, and the trade"},{"sec":23.6,"text":"went away with them. So what was the"},{"sec":25.3,"text":"solution? More discrimination against"},{"sec":27.3,"text":"Hindus. In 1704, they taxed Hindus who"},{"sec":30,"text":"stayed, and the only way to stop was to"},{"sec":32.6,"text":"convert. But in 1739, Chimaji [music]"},{"sec":34.9,"text":"Appa took their forts at Vasai, and the"},{"sec":36.7,"text":"Marathas demanded that tax go. So that"},{"sec":39.2,"text":"was the end, right? Well, the Portuguese"},{"sec":41.7,"text":"gave up the fort and territories, but on"},{"sec":43.6,"text":"the tax, they refused and they said it"},{"sec":45.7,"text":"was the matter of Catholic church and it"},{"sec":47.8,"text":"stayed for another 100 years."}],"text":""}}